      "date": "2026-06-01T16:53:53.000Z",
      "title": "Less than half of directors are independent",
      "body": "There are 6 new directors who have joined the board in the last 3 years. Of these new board members, 3 were independent directors. The company's board is composed of: 6 new directors. 1 experienced director. No highly experienced directors. 3 independent directors (4 non-independent directors). Non-executive Independent Director Gayatridevi Pandey is the most experienced director on the board, commencing their role in 2024. Non-Executive Independent Director Hiralben Gohil was the last independent director to join the board, commencing their role in 2026. The following issues are considered to be risks according to the Simply Wall St Risk Model: Minority of independent directors. Lack of board continuity. Lack of experienced directors.",
